<title>USA: Quickturn to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Quickturn to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quickturn Design Systems Inc said it plans to repurchase up to $10 million of its common stock from time to time in the open market.</p>
<p>It said the decision to repurchase shares reflects the low price at which its stock has traded recently, which it believes &quot;does not reflect the true long-term value of the company.&quot;</p>
<p>Quickturn closed Monday at 13-3/8, up 5/8. Its 52-week-high is 17, its low 8-5/8.</p>
